-- Adds DOI links to Issue 1's reference lists.
--
-- Each reference without a DOI was looked up in Crossref; a DOI was added
-- only where the title, year and first author all match the cited work
-- (39 references). It is appended as https://doi.org/..., the form
-- Crossref asks for. Also tidies two things carried over from the source
-- files: a stray "[6] O" at the end of one reference, and three entries
-- listed twice in "Local Content Development Programme".
--
-- Each update applies only if the list is unchanged since it was reviewed,
-- so an edit made in the admin since then is never overwritten. Safe to
-- run more than once (a second run changes nothing).

